{"id":"abb55776f8cac91e","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-presheaf-topos-structure.md","title":"Theorem — 筛对象分类预层子对象","display":"Theorem — 筛对象分类预层子对象","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-presheaf-topos-structure","aliases":["14-thm-presheaf-topos-structure"],"display":"Theorem — 筛对象分类预层子对象","source_ref":"I.4, pp.37–39; I.6, pp.44–47","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked","depends_on":["[[14-df-pullbacks-equalizers]]","[[14-df-subobject-classifier]]","[[14-df-elementary-topos]]","[[14-df-presheaf-sieve-classifier]]","[[14-df-presheaf-finite-limits]]","[[14-df-presheaf-exponentials]]","[[14-thm-presheaf-exponential-transposition]]","[[14-thm-pointwise-presheaf-morphism-tests]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-presheaf-topos-structure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-presheaf-topos-structure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — 筛对象分类预层子对象"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"I.4, pp.37–39; I.6, pp.44–47"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"199dc3cf97e92fa1\" href=\"?note=199dc3cf97e92fa1\" title=\"14-df-pullbacks-equalizers\">14-df-pullbacks-equalizers</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5\" href=\"?note=a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5\" title=\"14-df-subobject-classifier\">14-df-subobject-classifier</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" href=\"?note=4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" title=\"14-df-elementary-topos\">14-df-elementary-topos</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e1782799288dd0ec\" href=\"?note=e1782799288dd0ec\" title=\"14-df-presheaf-sieve-classifier\">14-df-presheaf-sieve-classifier</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"93c6dd137bf8628e\" href=\"?note=93c6dd137bf8628e\" title=\"14-df-presheaf-finite-limits\">14-df-presheaf-finite-limits</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a56025295f88eafd\" href=\"?note=a56025295f88eafd\" title=\"14-df-presheaf-exponentials\">14-df-presheaf-exponentials</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"fa971ebc9fa7af70\" href=\"?note=fa971ebc9fa7af70\" title=\"14-thm-presheaf-exponential-transposition\">14-thm-presheaf-exponential-transposition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"a15ef6697dd133a5\" href=\"?note=a15ef6697dd133a5\" title=\"14-thm-pointwise-presheaf-morphism-tests\">14-thm-pointwise-presheaf-morphism-tests</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>-小范畴，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega,\\operatorname{true},\\chi_A\">\\(\\Omega,\\operatorname{true},\\chi_A\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"e1782799288dd0ec\" href=\"?note=e1782799288dd0ec\" title=\"14-df-presheaf-sieve-classifier\">14-df-presheaf-sieve-classifier</a> 的构造，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq P\">\\(A\\subseteq P\\)</span> 为子预层，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m:A\\hookrightarrow P\">\\(m:A\\hookrightarrow P\\)</span> 为包含。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"!_A:A\\to1\">\\(!_A:A\\to1\\)</span> 是唯一终对象箭头。</p>\n<p>包含自然变换满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m_C(a)=a\">\\(m_C(a)=a\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\">\\(C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in A(C)\">\\(a\\in A(C)\\)</span>）；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\times_\\Omega1\">\\(P\\times_\\Omega1\\)</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_A,\\operatorname{true}\">\\(\\chi_A,\\operatorname{true}\\)</span> 的拉回。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\cong P\\times_{\\Omega}1,\\qquad\\operatorname{IsSubobjectClassifier}(\\Omega,\\operatorname{true}),\\qquad\\operatorname{IsElementaryTopos}(\\widehat{\\mathcal C}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\cong P\\times_{\\Omega}1,\\qquad\\operatorname{IsSubobjectClassifier}(\\Omega,\\operatorname{true}),\\qquad\\operatorname{IsElementaryTopos}(\\widehat{\\mathcal C}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\forall p\\in P(C)\\;(p\\in A(C)\\Longleftrightarrow(\\chi_A)_C(p)=t_C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\forall p\\in P(C)\\;(p\\in A(C)\\Longleftrightarrow(\\chi_A)_C(p)=t_C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsPullback}_{\\widehat{\\mathcal C}}(A,m,!_A,\\chi_A,\\operatorname{true}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{IsPullback}_{\\widehat{\\mathcal C}}(A,m,!_A,\\chi_A,\\operatorname{true}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in A(C)\">\\(p\\in A(C)\\)</span>，所有限制都在子预层中，故特征筛为最大筛；反向检查恒等箭头即可。拉回逐点计算，因而得到指定的分类方块。若另一自然变换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta:P\\to\\Omega\">\\(\\theta:P\\to\\Omega\\)</span> 给出同一拉回，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in\\theta_C(p)\">\\(u\\in\\theta_C(p)\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{id}_D\\in\\theta_D(P(u)p)\">\\(\\operatorname{id}_D\\in\\theta_D(P(u)p)\\)</span>，再由拉回条件当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P(u)p\\in A(D)\">\\(P(u)p\\in A(D)\\)</span>；故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta=\\chi_A\">\\(\\theta=\\chi_A\\)</span>。一般单态射逐点单射，因此与其像子预层同构，以上论证覆盖全部子对象。结合有限极限及指数得到预层范畴为初等拓扑斯。</p>\n<p>来源：Mac Lane–Moerdijk，I.4, pp.37–39; I.6, pp.44–47。此处来源定位沿用所附笔记；本次未获得所列原书文件。数学结构及必要条件以本条 Hypothesis 和 Assertion 为准。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-pullbacks-equalizers","status":"resolved","id":"199dc3cf97e92fa1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-pullbacks-equalizers]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-subobject-classifier","status":"resolved","id":"a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-subobject-classifier]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-elementary-topos","status":"resolved","id":"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-elementary-topos]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-presheaf-sieve-classifier","status":"resolved","id":"e1782799288dd0ec","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-presheaf-sieve-classifier]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-presheaf-finite-limits","status":"resolved","id":"93c6dd137bf8628e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-presheaf-finite-limits]]","embed":